{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure automatic persistence that drains entity changes and batches database writes."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is configured with one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/StateWriter","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" per "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["PersistencePlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","    writers: [","        StateWriter(keyPath: \\.items) { writes, deletes in","            for item in writes { try? await db.upsert(item) }","            for id in deletes  { try? await db.delete(id: id) }","        },","    ],","    debounce: .milliseconds(250)  \/\/ Default; configurable",")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When using "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"afterReduce"},{"type":"text","text":" is called automatically through the plugin lifecycle — no manual invocation needed. Register the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginHost","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and pass it to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s initializer."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await store.flush()"},{"text":" o